                                 Hordes & Holes
                               Documentation File
          Author:  Bruce M. Terry Jr.
          Date:    February 10, 1988
              "Hordes & Holes" is an action packed "run-for-your-life"
          game that will keep you playing for hours.  The object of the
          game is simply to survive.  There is not much strategy
          involved, only the instinct to survive.
              The game begins with you being placed in the center of
          the screen surrounded by hordes of monsters and holes.
          Instantly the monsters will swarm around you.  One touch, and
          you're a goner.  Your only hope is to evade the monsters and
          lure them into the holes before they can get you.  If all the
          monsters fall into holes, you have survived the level.  But
          don't relax, the next level is even harder!
              The game can be played in any 80 x 24 window.  There are
          three game characters:
              O - You
              X - Monster
              * - Hole
              Luring a monster into a hole will get you 10 points.  You
          may choose at the beginning of the program to have the sound
          effects on or off and use joystick or keyboard.  This is a
          simple game but you will be suprised at how entertaining it
          can be.
